OL,3,GNEWSASale listing of 'heritage asset'
OL,4,Awas human error
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sale of a 230-year-old Grade II*
OL,7,Flisted building has been described as
OL,8,F"human error" by a council.
OL,10,FThe Bury in Hemel Hempstead,
OL,11,FHertfordshire, was listed for sale by
OL,12,Fagents Brasier Freeth.
OL,14,FDacorum Borough Council, which owns the
OL,15,Fvacant building, has firmly denied it
OL,16,Fis being sold and confirmed that no
OL,17,F"decision has been taken to sell,
OL,18,Ftransfer or otherwise dispose of" it.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
