OL,3,GNEWSASale listing of 'heritage asset'
OL,4,Awas human error
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said its instruction to the agent
OL,7,Fwas to seek expressions of interest
OL,8,Fregarding the future use of the
OL,9,F"significant heritage asset".
